  "scenes": [
    {
      "name": "How it works",
      "text": "The title and what this film covers.",
      "startS": 0,
      "endS": 15.5
    },
    {
      "name": "Two names",
      "text": "Pravrudhi-Nyaya is the product; Prabhāsa-Nyāya is our own trained models; the system is a second reader that refers when it cannot support a statement.",
      "startS": 15.5,
      "endS": 38.9
    },
    {
      "name": "The corpus",
      "text": "Real judgments and orders are gathered, cleaned, read by two model readers, checked and split into training, held-out testing and evaluation sets.",
      "startS": 38.9,
      "endS": 85.3
    },
    {
      "name": "Element judges",
      "text": "An offence is broken into ingredients; a 4B judge scores each, a 32B judge checks the same ones, and the AND rule needs both.",
      "startS": 85.3,
      "endS": 133.3
    },
    {
      "name": "The harness",
      "text": "Deterministic assembly, the quote check, the Lean structure check and refer-first decide; no model decides.",
      "startS": 133.3,
      "endS": 180.4
    },
    {
      "name": "Nyaya grounding",
      "text": "Pramana, nirnaya withheld and agama, explained in plain words.",
      "startS": 180.4,
      "endS": 210.70000000000002
    },
    {
      "name": "The assistant",
      "text": "The optional Claude managed-agent assistant: consent, spending limits, and the core still decides.",
      "startS": 210.70000000000002,
      "endS": 236.70000000000002
    },
    {
      "name": "Citations",
      "text": "An existence-only check against an index of judgments, and the rule that keeps a name match from passing as proof.",
      "startS": 236.70000000000002,
      "endS": 279.6
    },
    {
      "name": "Matter tools",
      "text": "Matter tools: add the papers of a matter; the tools that use them.",
      "startS": 279.6,
      "endS": 305.6
    },
    {
      "name": "Serving and cost",
      "text": "The judges run on rented serverless GPUs.",
      "startS": 305.6,
      "endS": 332.70000000000005
    },
    {
      "name": "Evaluation discipline",
      "text": "Evaluation kept out of training, looks counted, and null results reported.",
      "startS": 332.70000000000005,
      "endS": 403.1
    },
    {
      "name": "End card",
      "text": "Name, line and where to find the NyayaSiddhi dataset and the Benchmarks page.",
      "startS": 403.1,
      "endS": 411.1
    }
  ],
